   "locked": false,
   "text": "1. the judge grades a minibatch of 8 physician-labelled items\n2. Claude Sonnet 5.5 (the reflector) reads its verdicts next\n    to the physicians' labels and proposes a new prompt\n3. better on the minibatch -> scored on validation;\n    the best on validation wins: gepa-v1\ntrain 400 / val 200 items, none from test conversations;\n6 of 34 rubric categories held out of both",
